Yemeni army orders evacuation of Aden airport as it warns of Saudi arms shipment

Yemen’s armed forces have warned civilians to evacuate Aden International Airport, saying a Saudi military cargo plane carrying weapons intended for use against the Yemeni people is at the facility in the southern port city, where the Saudi-backed Presidential Leadership Council (PLC) is based.

